{% extends "layouts/website.njk" %}

{% block head %}
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://hckr.studio/">
  <meta property="og:image" content="{{ "og-image.png" | assetUrl("images") }}">
  <link rel="me" href="https://bsky.app/profile/hckr.studio">
{% endblock %}

{% set bodySchema = "Corporation" %}
{% block content %}
  <main>
    <div>
      <time datetime="2021-01-30" property="foundingDate"></time>
      <data value="1" property="numberOfEmployees"></data>
    </div>
    <section id="hero">
      {% texy %}
        ## Engineering that pays for itself. .[claim]{property: slogan}

        *Data that keeps flowing Systems that don't wake you up. Bills that go down.*

        A small studio by choice. Big enough to deliver, small enough that you always know who you're talking to.
        We help companies take over troubled systems, cut what they spend on running them, and ship what actually
        moves the business.

        We are who we are — decades of shipped systems, no corporate blandness, no cosplay. We've run operations,
        budgets and delivery ourselves, so we optimize for your business results, not for tech vanity.
      {% endtexy %}
    </section>

    <section id="what-we-do">
      <h2>what we do</h2>
      {% texy %}
        *A DevOps/FinOps consultancy — measured in your outcomes, not our activity.*

        **FinOps** — we audit what your systems really cost and cut the bill.
         → Predictable spend, flat at peak

        **DevOps** — we make delivery pipelines, reliability and lead time measurably better.
         → Ship in weeks, sleep through the night

        **Agentic AI optimization** — we know where small models beat big ones, where a decision engine beats a model, and when it pays to take the models home. We run our own in-house GPU cluster for exactly this work.
         → Effective AI in-house, on your own hardware, without the millions

        **Web quality** — performance, accessibility and long-term maintainability, built in — not bolted on.
         → Sites that stay fast, work for everyone, and age well

        **Legacy takeover** — the system nobody wants to touch still carries your business value. We don't break it — we pay off its technical debt, then make it earn interest.
         → Debt paid down, value earning interest

        **Start small:** System Health Audit → Optimization Sprint → Managed Operations. Fixed scope, fixed price, defined output — no obligation to continue.
      {% endtexy %}
    </section>
    <section id="why-us">
      <h2>why us</h2>
      {% texy %}
        - **We understand the business, not just the tech.** We've run operations, budgets and delivery ourselves — every recommendation is weighed against your margin and lead time, not against tech vanity.
        - **Evidence over impressions.** Every claim comes with a measured before/after. We audit with numbers, we deliver with numbers.
        - **Direct senior engagement.** You talk to the people who build your system. No account managers, no handoffs.
        - **Built for the long run.** Most of our client relationships are measured in years, not sprints.
      {% endtexy %}
    </section>
    <section id="selected-work">
      <h2>selected work</h2>
      {% texy %}
        **Hlídač shopů** — "hlidacshopu.cz":[https://hlidacshopu.cz]
         System architecture: browser extension, web and mobile apps. Cost-optimized to run in a tiny team, for years.

        **MyTrees**
         Legacy teake over. A loyalty platform we took over, stabilized and refactored for international expansion.
        Rewards computation: **45 min → 10 s**.

        **NielsenIQ**
         Pipeline redesign: unreliable process with limited batch sizes and months-long lead times → dependable, unlimited
        batch sizes, lead times in weeks.

        **European Commission — Price Reduction Tool**
         Solution architecture and PoC running within 3 months, on the EU design system.
      {% endtexy %}
    </section>
    <section id="people">
      <h2>people</h2>
      {% texy %}
        **Aleš Roubíček**:[https://www.rarous.net] — partner &amp; principal engineer.

        We scale with trusted specialist collaborators we've shipped with for years.
      {% endtexy %}
    </section>

    <section id="partners">
